# A chat on a computer, words in its composer, the window made narrower, wider and shorter: the composer goes with
# the page at once, as nothing it moves for changed (docs/motion.md): MBUI_FIXTURE=webdemo MBUI_WIN=1280x800.
timeout 20000
until 新建对话
wait 600
tap 把那个弄一下
wait 900
type 帮我看一下登录按钮
wait 600
resize 1100 800
wait 100
resize 960 800
wait 100
resize 1280 800
wait 700
resize 1280 660
wait 700
resize 1280 800
wait 700
exit
